
VALOR Framework readme [ WORK IN PROGRESS ] 

run ./configure and then make to build the framework

External dependency setup:
 "make color" installs colorgcc if you want it. It makes g++ output more readable (like Clang's is). "make colorclean" to delete
 "make python" build a python virtualenv, with ipython and numpy. This should ensure support for the VALOR python scripts. "make pythonclean" to delete
